 poetcovestimator riskmodel  
     

    thresh soft    soft 
    thresh hard    hard 
    thresh scad    scad init num factors  int   0  thresh  float   1 0  thresh method  str    soft     kwargs  
         
        super     init     kwargs num factors    0   `num factors` requires positive integer num factors   num factors thresh    0   `thresh` requires positive float number thresh   thresh thresh method thresh hard thresh soft thresh scad 
            `thresh method soft` `hard` `scad thresh method   thresh method predict x  np ndarray  -  np ndarray 
        y   x t   
        p  n   y shape num factors   0 
            dd  v   np linalg eig y t dot y  
            v   v    np argsort dd  
            f   v num factors         -1    np sqrt n 
            lampca   y dot f    n
            uhat   np asarray y - lampca dot f t  
            lowrank   np asarray lampca dot lampca t  
            rate   1   np sqrt p    np sqrt np log p    n uhat   np asarray y 
            rate   np sqrt np log p    n 
            lowrank   0

        lamb   rate thresh
        supca   uhat dot uhat t    n
        sudiag   np diag np diag supca  
        r   np linalg inv sudiag  0 5  dot supca  dot np linalg inv sudiag  0 5 thresh method thresh hard 
            m   r    np abs r    lamb thresh method thresh soft 
            res   np abs r  - lamb
            res    res   np abs res     2
            m   np sign r    res m1    np abs r    2   lamb    np sign r     np abs r  - lamb     np abs r    lamb 
            m2    np abs r    3 7   lamb     np abs r     2   lamb     2 7   r - 3 7   np sign r    lamb    1 7
            m3    np abs r     3 7   lamb    r
            m   m1   m2   m3

        rthresh   m - np diag np diag m     np eye p 
        sigmau    sudiag  0 5  dot rthresh  dot sudiag  0 5 
        sigmay   sigmau   lowrank sigmay
  model riskmodel poet